  "reference": "2 Ayi 19",
  "verseCount": 37,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "19",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "2KI 19"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "19",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mwenye Hesekiya akuŵenda lunda kwa Yesaya",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hesekiya ali ayipikene yeleyi, ŵapapulenye yakuwala yakwe mwa canasa, ŵawete ciguduli, ni ŵajile kwinjila m'Nyumba ja AMBUJE.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jwalakwejo ŵamsalile Eliyakimu juŵaliji kapitawo jwamkulungwa jwa ku nyumba ja mwenye, Shebina juŵaliji kalembela jwa mwenye, ni soni ŵakutaga mbopesi ŵacakulungwakulungwa, kuti awale yiguduli ni kwawula kwa jwakulocesya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Yesaya, mwanace jwa Amosi, kuja kumsalila kuti, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Lelo lili lisiku lya yisawusyo, lyakupocela cilango ni lyakutesya soni. Tuli mpela jwamkongwe jwasigele panandi kuŵeleka mwanace, nambo nganakola macili gakuŵelecela mwanacejo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenye jwa ku Asiliya amtumile jwamkulungwa jwa asilikali ŵa ngondo kukumnyosya Mlungu jwa umi. Tukwaŵenda camnopemnope AMBUJE Mlungu ŵenu, kuti akupikane kunyosya kweleku, nipo ŵape cilango ŵele ŵandu ŵa mnyosisyewo. Ni ligongo lyakwe tukumŵenda m'mwejo kuti mtupopelele uweji ŵandu ŵatusigalile ciŵela ni umi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesaya piŵagapikene maloŵe ga Mwenye Hesekiyago, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "jwalakwejo ŵatite kuti, “Mkasalile Mwenye Hesekiya kuti, ‘AMBUJE akumsalila kuti, mkatenda woga ni maloŵe gakuŵeceta ŵakutumicila ŵa mwenye jwa ku Asiliya, gakunyosya nago une. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Une tiŵice mu mtima mwa mwenyejo nganisyo sine syakuti, pitacipikana ngani, ndaŵi jijojo taciwujila kucilambo ca kumangwawo, nipo une tingamwulajile kumangwawo peko.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŵandu ŵa ku Asiliya akutumisya soni ngondo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jwamkulungwa jwa ngondo jula ŵapikene kuti mwenye jwa ku Asiliya jula ŵatyosile ku Lakishi, nipo kuti ŵaliji mkuputa ngondo ni msinda wa Libina. Myoyo ŵajawile kweleko kuja kuŵecetana najo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Piŵapikene mwenye jwa ku Asiliya kuti Mwenye Tilihaka jwa ku Ifiyopiya akwisa kumenyana najo ngondo, ŵatumile soni ŵamitenga kwa Mwenye Hesekiya ni cikalata ca maloŵe gakuti, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mlungu jwenu jumkumkulupililajo, akasamnyenga kuti m'mwejo timkulupuce m'magasa mwangu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "M'mwejo mŵele mli mkupikana yakusatenda ayimwene ŵa ku Asiliya pa yilambo yosope yakusasaka kuyijonanga, kuti ŵamasile kuyijonanga yosope yene. Ana m'mwejope ni ŵampaka mkulupuce? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Acinangolo ŵangu ŵajijonasile misinda ja Gosani, Halani ni Lesefe. Nipo ŵawuleje ŵandu ŵa ku Edeni ŵaŵatamaga ku Telasa. Ana m'mweji mwapikene kuti milungu ja ŵandu ŵa mitundu jinewo jakulupwisye? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambi ayimwene ŵa m'misinda ja Hamati, Alipadi, Sefalafayimu ni Ifa, ali kwapi?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenye Hesekiya ŵapocele cikalata kwa ŵandu ŵa mitenga ŵala, ni ŵaciŵalasile. Ali amasile kuciŵalanga cikalataco, ŵajawile ku Nyumba ja AMBUJE ni ŵaciŵisile cikalataco mwelemo pameso pa AMBUJE, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ni ŵapopesile kwa AMBUJEWO kuti, “Ŵalakwe AMBUJE, Mlungu jwa Aisalaeli, ŵakusatama pa mpando wawo wa ucimwene pacanya pa akelubi, ŵalakwe jika ni ŵakusalamula ayimwene wosope ŵa pacilambo capasi. Ŵalakwe ni ŵaŵapanganyisye cilambo ca kwinani ni capasi pano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.25.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Eks 25:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sambano ŵalakwe AMBUJE, alole yindu yikututendecela uwejiyi. Agapikane maloŵe gosope gaŵaŵecete Senakelibu, gakwanyosya ŵalakwe Mlungu jwa umi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwe wosope tukumanyilila AMBUJE kuti ayimwene ŵa ku Asiliya ŵajijonasile mitundu jejinji, ni kuyisandusya yilambo yawo yipululu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵajijocice moto milungu jawo, jele jimkanijiŵa milungu kose, nambo milungu jakusepa ja yitela ni maganga, jakupanganyikwa ni ŵandu, ni ligongo lyakwe ŵayijonasile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sambano ŵalakwe AMBUJE Mlungu jwetu, tukwaŵenda kuti, conde atukulupusye uweji kwa Asiliya ŵeleŵa, kuti mitundu josope japasi jimanyilile kuti ŵalakwe jika, AMBUJE, ali Mlungu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesaya akutumisya mtenga kwa mwenye",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesaya ŵatumisye kwa Mwenye Hesekiya maloŵe gakumsalila kuti AMBUJE, Mlungu jwa Aisalaeli, alipikene lipopelo lyakwe lila lyakusala ya Mwenye Senakelibu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sambano pa kusisya yaŵecete Mwenye Senakelibujo, AMBUJE Mlungu akuti, “Msinda wa Siyoni",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ukumnyosya ni kumseka m'mwejo Senakelibu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ana m'mweji mwanyosisye ni kwalalatila ŵani? M'mwejo munyosisye une Mlungu Jwamswela jula jwa Aisalaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwatumisye ŵamitenga ŵenu kukunyosya uneji, mli mkusala kuti, ‘Ni mageleta gangu gamajinji nagapundile pa ngondo matumbi gamalewulewu ga Lebanoni. Mwaliji mkulikwesya soni kuti mwajinjile mkati msyesyene mwa ukweti, ni mwagwisisye yitela yamikungusa yayilewulewu, pamo ni yitela ya payini yambone mnope mwelemo.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwaliji mkulilapilila mwasyene kuti, ‘Sajo sya asilikali ŵangu syaliŵete ni kugajumusya mesi ga sulo syosope sya mcilambo ca Iguputo. Namwele mesi mu yisima yinawukwile namsyene ku yilambo ya cilendo.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nambo une AMBUJE ngumsalila m'mwejo Senakelibu kuti, yindu yeleyi nayikolosisye uneji kalakala. M'mwejo ngamkumanyilila kuti une jika ni junaganisisye yakumtuma m'mwejo kuti myitende yindu yeleyi. Nipo sambano yosope yitendekwe. Une nampele m'mwejo macili gagwicisya misinda ni kujisandusya kuŵa mawunjili ga maganga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵandu ŵaliji m'misindamo ŵaliji ŵangali macili, wakamwile woga, nipo nganisyo syawo syasokonocele. Ŵaliji ŵangali macili mpela mugakuŵela manyasi gagakumela m'migunda, kapena manyasi gakumela pa msakasa, gele gakusajumula ni mbungo ja mtukuta mkanigakule.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nambotu une nguyimanyilila yosope yenumwe, yosope yimkutenda ni kosope kumkuja. Soni ngumanyilila yimkuti pakundumbilila une. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 19:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakuweni kulikwesya kwenu soni nagapikene maloŵe genu gakunyosya une. Sambano tinalukolece lupula lwenu ni cisopo, ni kukoleka cisyano mkamwa mwenu. Nipo tinamwusye kumangwenu pakumpitisya mwitala limwapitile pakwisa akuno.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.19.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.19.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
